{
  "id": "poem-007",
  "body": "<div class=\"poem-text\"><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-1\"><span class=\"poem-line\">金翅鸟命终，骨肉尽消散，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">唯有心不化，圆明光灿烂。</span><span class=\"poem-line\">龙王取为珠，能破千年暗。</span><span class=\"poem-line\">转轮得如意，能救一切难。</span><span class=\"poem-line\">如合在人中，日用而不见。</span></p></div><p class=\"poem-source-note\">（摘选自明代憨山大师《六咏诗》）</p><figure class=\"poem-illustration\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"poem-art-open\" data-poem-art=\"/books/jing-mi-de-kuang-chao/art/007.webp\" data-caption=\"《羽毛》\" aria-label=\"放大欣赏插画《羽毛》\"><img src=\"/books/jing-mi-de-kuang-chao/art/007.webp\" width=\"885\" height=\"1050\" alt=\"亮子绘制的原书插画《羽毛》\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></button><figcaption>《羽毛》 · 亮子<span>轻触画面，放大欣赏</span></figcaption></figure><p class=\"poem-original-page\">原书第 7 页</p>"
}
